# Git worktrees

Isolated feature work for this repo lives outside the main checkout.

- Directory: `/Users/weigangchen/orca/workspaces/宝可梦游戏/<fish-name>/`
- Pick a short unused fish name (existing: inconnu, perch, redfish, sole, trout, herring).
- Branch: `ddrdjboy/feature-<topic>` (or `ddrdjboy/fix-<topic>` for a bugfix).
- Create with `git worktree add` from the current HEAD. Do not implement feature work directly on `main`.
- Do not use `.worktrees/` inside the repo.

```bash
git worktree add "/Users/weigangchen/orca/workspaces/宝可梦游戏/herring" -b ddrdjboy/feature-party-detail
```
